                        "entry_id": "89ef37ee-f76d-3cdf-9960-7bf03809771f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A dish served in the parmigiana style (combined with cheese and coated with tomato sauce before baking)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc47a90b-09d4-4e52-bc78-9399a83a974d",
                                "sense_id": "1c8f29d8-6269-3a24-9274-c87594175335",
                                "text": "Everyone who's had my mother's eggplant parm has said, “This is awesome.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7edc6618-cd0b-4a17-9ae6-66096ca502cd",
                                "sense_id": "1c8f29d8-6269-3a24-9274-c87594175335",
                                "text": "For this update on a chicken parm sandwich, I bread and sauté thin chicken breast cutlets and layer them with fresh basil, mozzarella cheese, and leftover spaghetti on garlic-buttered ciabatta."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af1d65fc-80fb-4586-9148-cf77edbec001",
                                "sense_id": "1c8f29d8-6269-3a24-9274-c87594175335",
                                "text": "This braised eggplant has all those savory parm-y flavors, but in an easy any-night form."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b92898f-5a95-4e72-820c-bca2c0506c38",
                                "sense_id": "1c8f29d8-6269-3a24-9274-c87594175335",
                                "text": "chicken parm"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33cbdca9-e898-3cc2-bdd9-e7372bc026f2",
                        "entry_id": "89ef37ee-f76d-3cdf-9960-7bf03809771f",
                        "glosses": [
