                                "sense_id": "33cbdca9-e898-3cc2-bdd9-e7372bc026f2",
                                "text": "Go make some spaghetti for lunch n sprinkle on some parm"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb88e53d-2ed4-419e-b8bb-d49517c9ab4f",
                                "sense_id": "33cbdca9-e898-3cc2-bdd9-e7372bc026f2",
                                "text": "Once it's bubbling good and steady, grab some parm and pecorino, pop it all on your spaghetti."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e88fc4ac-4722-4372-9e94-67cdd086c667",
                                "sense_id": "33cbdca9-e898-3cc2-bdd9-e7372bc026f2",
                                "text": "'There's parm in that bowl there,' Lady Darvish said."
